---
import PolicyLayout from '../layouts/PolicyLayout.astro';
---

<PolicyLayout title="Privacy information">
  <h2>Contact and estimate requests</h2>
  <p>
    When you submit an estimate request, we send your name, email address, phone
    number, selected service, and project details to the Abrajan team through
    Resend. The team uses this information to respond to your inquiry. Requests
    are delivered by email; this website does not maintain a separate
    submissions database. Please do not include sensitive personal information.
  </p>
  <h2>Google Maps reviews</h2>
  <p>
    When the review section approaches your screen, this website requests public
    business reviews through its server. Review text, names, and dates are
    displayed for that page visit, without storing a local review database or a
    browser cache of the review response. Reviewer images load from Google;
    Google receives the information normally associated with an image request,
    such as your IP address and browser details.
  </p>
  <p>
    The{' '}
    <a
      href="https://policies.google.com/privacy"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
      Google Privacy Policy
    </a>{' '}
    is incorporated here for the Google Maps feature. Following a review or
    profile link opens Google, where Google’s policies apply.
  </p>
  <h2>YouTube video</h2>
  <p>
    The homepage video preview is hosted on this website. When you select it, we
    load a YouTube player using privacy-enhanced mode. YouTube then receives
    technical information such as your IP address and browser details, and its
    privacy policy applies. You can also choose to watch directly on YouTube.
  </p>
  <h2>Website operation</h2>
  <p>
    Hosting infrastructure processes technical request information to deliver
    the website and protect it from abuse. This website does not include
    advertising trackers, an analytics script, or a marketing-cookie system.
  </p>
  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>
    For questions about information you have submitted, please use our
    <a href="/contact/">contact form</a>.
  </p>
</PolicyLayout>
